      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am surprised there is no much people for this request. Because it's still very useful visual for me if nametags is turned off, you will see nothing but you hear someone is talked.\nSo you want look around who is talking but nametags are off...\nSo popped talk icon above head is very welcome.\nAlso Friend icon and 'block hearing' or 'no talk' icon are good to see on the users.\n\nYou don't want turn nametags again on/off for that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-23T11:47:05.157Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hidden nametags is good option to clean up view, especially in busy rooms where many nametags blocks almost your view. \nTurn it off gives clean view, but now there is new problem.. if someone is talking, you want see where it coming from.\n\nIt's good idea add option to let it just flash speaking icon above the head of player and when done speaking, it will hide.\nMuch easier for me to see who is talking.\nShould useful for busy areas and you don't know who is talking now.\n\nSame way, it can also used to keep friend icon visible all time without nametags. You can see better who are your friends and not. It's just small icon above head.",
